        "uuid": "8396fec8_4ebed144",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000032
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-17T19:13:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand how you arrived at the conclusion. Given it is a goal for Skia to generalize the BGL, shouldn\u0027t we also support the general thing and not rely on a particular ordering of the bindings?\nIMO the semantics based on particular ordering are a bit too magic.",
      "parentUuid": "ce69ca85_bb49e1fc",
      "revId": "fba45ffc8efb366cdb232ca5f3b996aeb84f3ce3",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c62f96f7_789c1337",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000122
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-18T16:59:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed with respect to the magic.\n\nAustin, Vasiliy, and I synced up. Here are our conclusions:\n\n* While Skia might generalize their BGL in the future, it is not a near-term goal, and hence we should build a solution that works for the near-term use case.\n* It\u0027s possible in the near term that Skia will have shaders that have a YCbCr sampler/texture pair + a different texture (e.g., for a mask effect). Hence, the restriction \"BGLs with a YCbCr sampler must have only one other texture\" is too strict.\n* However, it\u0027s fine to require that YCbCr sampler entries be paired with texture entries - the reason is that the texture comes from an AHB and the YCbCr info comes from the same AHB. If the client is sampling two AHBs in the same shader, they wouldn\u0027t in general know that those two AHBs are going to have the same external format.\n* So, what we\u0027re planning to do is add a field to the StaticSamplerBindingLayout that gives the index of the texture that will be sampled by this sampler. The client will need to set that field if the sampler is a YCbCr sampler.",
      "parentUuid": "8396fec8_4ebed144",
      "revId": "fba45ffc8efb366cdb232ca5f3b996aeb84f3ce3",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
