      "writtenOn": "2024-07-17T14:10:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMHO we could precompute the destination bindingIndex for each binding in BindGroupLayoutVk and use this directly here, likewise for VulkanDescriptorType. This would avoid logic in this fairly hot code, with pre-computations moved to cold BGL creation. This would remove the need to edit the code below as well.",
